# Agent feeds a heredoc to bash through `|&`: the body is code bash runs; the
# guard does not model `|&`, so it must keep every word (fail closed;
# ADR-0037, ADR-0043, ADR-0049; critic finding on c82dc67)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "cat <<EOF |& bash\nrm -rf xtask\nEOF"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
